* Self-authored fixture for the round-trip test (see ../roundtrip.rs).
* A 2-turn square spiral, outer extent 4 mm, drawn as the standard
* non-self-intersecting integer square spiral (step lengths 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 3,
* 4, 4 turns of pitch 1 mm): 8 segments of 0.2 mm x 35 um copper trace.
.title 2-turn square spiral
.units m
.default z=0 w=2e-4 h=3.5e-5 sigma=5.8e7 nwinc=3 nhinc=2
n0 x=0 y=0
n1 x=1e-3 y=0
n2 x=1e-3 y=1e-3
n3 x=-1e-3 y=1e-3
n4 x=-1e-3 y=-1e-3
n5 x=2e-3 y=-1e-3
n6 x=2e-3 y=2e-3
n7 x=-2e-3 y=2e-3
n8 x=-2e-3 y=-2e-3
e1 n0 n1
e2 n1 n2
e3 n2 n3
e4 n3 n4
e5 n4 n5
e6 n5 n6
e7 n6 n7
e8 n7 n8
.external n0 n8 spiral
.freq fmin=1e6 fmax=1e9 ndec=1
.end
